nd shows how Council taxes, which in large part went to pay salaries, fell most heavily on the poorest ghetto inhabitants. Along with the well-known brutality and self-aggrandizement of ghetto police, the horrifying caricature of a competitive society within the whole ghetto is described. Perhaps the most striking aspect of Trunk's treatment is his stress on the Councils' \"\"rescue through work\"\" strategy -- building a disciplined slave labor force to prove the Jews' value to the Nazi war economy.","primaryTopic":"World War II","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"World History","confidence":"medium","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"World History","score":8,"evidenceCount":1}],"evidence":[{"source":"llm_classifier","rawLabel":"World History","mappedSubject":"World History","score":8,"confidence":"high","note":"The book primarily focuses on the Jewish Councils in Nazi-occupied Eastern Europe, making it a significant work on World History, particularly in the context of the Holocaust and its political implications.","id":"subject-evidence-book-judenrat-the-jewish-councils-in-eastern-europe-under-nazi-occupation-isaiah-trunk-1"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Genocide","mappedSubject":"War & Military","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-judenrat-the-jewish-councils-in-eastern-europe-under-nazi-occupation-isaiah-trunk","id":"subject-evidence-book-judenrat-the-jewish-councils-in-eastern-europe-under-nazi-occupation-isaiah-trunk-6"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"World War, 1939-1945","mappedSubject":"War & Military","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-judenrat-the-jewish-councils-in-eastern-europe-under-nazi-occupation-isaiah-trunk","id":"subject-evidence-book-judenrat-the-jewish-councils-in-eastern-europe-under-nazi-occupation-isaiah-trunk-7"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Politics an